    "detailed_description": "In the early 2030s, an event named The Fall shook London and introduced humanity to Vornovians, extraterrestrial beings from Proxima Centauri. What began as a misunderstanding escalated into a human-Vornovian conflict, resolved after 18 months through diplomacy, allowing coexistence and collaboration. Peace has endured for two decades, with Vornovians becoming integral parts of Earth's society.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846350/extras/ef05b1157fb317e7b665099e2ee58602.avif?t=1711464413\" width=500 height=250 /></span><br><br>Sherr-Lok, a detective with unconventional methods, aids the Doyle District Detective Bureau and offers private investigative services. Watt-Sun, once a frontline soldier, battled a decade of homelessness and PTSD before Sherr-Lok mentored him into becoming a detective.<br><br>Sherr-Lok and Watt-Sun's next journey sees them navigate a mysterious case involving Peter Baskerville, heir to the infamous Baskerville Hall, just mere months after the death of his uncle. Threats against Peter's life provide the backdrop for a captivating narrative filled with escaped prisoners, shadowy organisations, and a supposed curse that has lasted over 200 years. Sherr-Lok and Watt-Sun take on the case and fight to find the truth behind the long-running mystery.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846350/extras/e6d2adb68ae83c2999103b4ccfaab17b.avif?t=1711464413\" width=500 height=250 /></span><br><br>FEATURES <br><br>Save/Load System: Safeguard your progress and continue your adventure at your convenience.<br>Questions: Navigate through a story that challenges players to prove their knowledge, with correct answers determining unknown consequences.<br>Music Gallery: Immerse yourself in the game's ambience with a curated soundtrack by Cameron Keywood, brought to life by the musical talents of Tim Beek.",
